  << /ActualText (SUMMARY\nDeveloping knowledge in Software Development with attention to clean design\054 creative problem\055solving\054 and a project\055driven approach to learning and application\056 Eager to transition into the tech industry and contribute her technical\054 analytical and creativity in a dynamic work environment\056\n\nEDUCATION\nLaGuardia Community College \055 AAS Programming \046 Software Development \174 March 2024 \055 June 2026\nSUNY Old Westbury \055 Computer Science \174 27 Transfer Credits\n\nEXPERIENCE\nPre\055Apprenticeship Software Development Bootcamp \055 Wells Fargo \174 June 2025 \055 August 2025\n\200 Gained Hands\055On experience with Scrum and Agile Methodologies\n\200 Collaborated with peers on a final project involving data visualization and presentation\n\200 Completed professional development workshops led by Wells Fargo on networking\054 personal branding\054 and technical interview preparation\n\nWarehouse Associate \055 OMLOG \174 September 2022 \055 January 2023\n\200 Identified and resolved inventory discrepancies and order fulfillment issues\n\200 Collaborated closely with team members to meet daily shipping and receiving goals\054 ensuring smooth workflow\n\200 Communicated effectively with team leads to report progress\054 clarify instructions\054 and escalate issues\n\nCERTIFICATES\nCertificate of Completion \055 Wells Fargo \174 June 2025 \055 August 2025\nWeb Development \055 SheCodes PLUS \174 Dec 2022 \055 Feb 2023\nIntroduction to Coding \055 SheCodes BASICS \174 Nov 2022 \055 Dec 2022\n)
